                {
                  "nodeType": "heading-2",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "Best Practices",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "Over the years, Liz has helped set the standard for best practices that produce optimal results in the multicultural space. Her approach is to help our clients put multicultural opportunities into perspective.",
